    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "20. Strategic Reserves",
    "ruleNumber": "20.03",
    "summary": "Strategic reserves units arrive by Ingress move (20.04), from battle round 2 onwards unless a rule says otherwise.\n\nAs battle round 3 ends, unless a rule says otherwise, each strategic reserves unit that has never made an Ingress move is destroyed, except:\n\n- units inside **TRANSPORTS** that have already arrived by Ingress move\n- repositioned units (20.02)\n\nA rule about a unit set up as Reinforcements means one that arrived by Ingress move.",
